  Experimental features
  Toggle experimental features. Changes are saved to config.toml.

  [ ] Network proxy                Apply network proxy restrictions to sandboxed sessions that
                                   already have network access.
› [ ] Dynamic workflows            Run JS-authored dynamic workflows that orchestrate code mode
                                   and multi-agent runs. Changes take effect after restarting
                                   Codex.
  [ ] Prevent sleep while running  Keep your computer awake while Codex is running a thread.

  Press space to select or enter to save for next conversation
